# ⚽ Football App

A polished football app UI built with Expo and React Native, designed for modern league dashboards and Ideavo-style portfolio showcases.

## Features

- Minimalist dark dashboard
- Overview, Stats, and Teams tabs
- Fixtures and live match card
- Leaderboard and standings views
- Ready for Expo/EAS builds

## Run locally

```bash
npm install
npm start
```

## Build

```bash
eas build --platform all
```

## Notes

This repo is prepared for deployment-friendly integration with services like Ideavo.ai, with a clean app structure and a modern mobile-first interface.

---

